<title>UK: Achmea Hypo raises 500 mln guilders via two bonds.</title>
<headline>Achmea Hypo raises 500 mln guilders via two bonds.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Achmea Hypothekenbank has issued two bonds worth a total 500 million guilders, lead manager ABN AMRO Hoare Govett said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>There is a 300 million guilder 10-year at a 31 basis points spread and a 200 million guilder five-year at a 17 b.p. spread.</p>
